"automatically install the missing debugging information packages. If this "
"method\n"
"does not work, read <link url='%1'>How to create useful crash reports</link> "
"to learn how to get a useful\n"
"backtrace, install the needed packages (<link url='%2'>list of files</"
"link>), then click the <interface>Reload</interface> button."
msgstr "Kliknite gumb <interface>Instaliraj simbole za otklanjanje pogrešaka</interface> kako biste automatski instalirali pakete s nedostajućim podacima za otklanjanje pogrešaka.\nAko to ne uspije, pročitajte <link url='%1'>Kako izraditi korisna izvješća o rušenju</link> da biste saznali kako dobiti koristan\ntrag poziva, instalirajte potrebne pakete (<link url='%2'>popis datoteka</link>), a zatim kliknite gumb <interface>Ponovno učitaj</interface>."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:227
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Read <link url='%1'>How to create useful crash reports</link> to learn how "
"to get a useful backtrace, install the needed packages\n"
"(<link url='%2'>list of files</link>), then click the <interface>Reload</"
"interface> button."
msgstr "Pročitajte <link url='%1'>Kako izraditi korisna izvješća o rušenju</link> da biste saznali kako dobiti koristan trag poziva, instalirajte potrebne pakete\n(<link url='%2'>popis datoteka</link>), a zatim kliknite gumb <interface>Ponovno učitaj</interface>."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:234
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Try to regenerate the backtrace by clicking the <interface>Reload</"
"interface> button."
msgstr "Pokušajte ponovno izraditi trag poziva klikom na gumb <interface>Ponovno učitaj</interface>."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:237
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"The backtrace generation failed to prepare. This indicates a severe problem "
"which you likely cannot resolve."
msgstr "Priprema izrade traga poziva nije uspjela. To upućuje na ozbiljan problem koji vjerojatno ne možete riješiti."

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:241
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"<emphasis strong='true'>First install the debugger application (%1), then "
"click the <interface>Reload</interface> button.</emphasis>"
msgstr "<emphasis strong='true'>Najprije instalirajte program za otklanjanje pogrešaka (%1), a zatim kliknite gumb <interface>Ponovno učitaj</interface>.</emphasis>"

#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:245
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"The backtrace generation was stopped due to memory pressure. You could try "
"to regenerate the backtrace by clicking the <interface>Reload</interface> "
"button."
msgstr "Izrada traga poziva zaustavljena je zbog nedostatka memorije. Pokušajte ponovno izraditi trag poziva klikom na gumb <interface>Ponovno učitaj</interface>."

#. i18nc here because that'd close the html tag but we need to append an unordered list of paths
#: qml/DeveloperPage.qml:269
msgid ""
"The packages containing debug information for the following application and "
"libraries are missing:"
msgstr "Nedostaju paketi s podacima za otklanjanje pogrešaka za sljedeću aplikaciju i biblioteke:"

#: qml/DownloadSymbolsCheckBox.qml:20
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Automatically download debug symbols to enhance crash reports"
msgstr "Automatski preuzmi simbole za otklanjanje pogrešaka kako bi se poboljšala izvješća o rušenju"

#: qml/DownloadSymbolsCheckBox.qml:29
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Crash reports can be of greater value if additional debugging resources are "
"downloaded from your distributor first.\n"
"This may also cause increased memory usage, will take longer, and causes "
"downloads of unknown size when a crash occurs. This is skipped automatically "
"when using a metered internet connection."
msgstr "Izvješća o rušenju mogu biti korisnija ako se najprije preuzmu dodatni resursi za otklanjanje pogrešaka od distributera.\nTo može povećati potrošnju memorije, produljiti postupak i uzrokovati preuzimanje nepoznate količine podataka pri rušenju. Preuzimanje se automatski preskače pri korištenju internetske veze s ograničenim prometom."

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:14
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Log in to the Bug Tracking System"
msgstr "Prijava u sustav za praćenje grešaka"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:66
msgctxt "@info:status '1' is replaced with the short URL of the bugzilla "
msgid "You need to login with your %1 account in order to proceed."
msgstr "Za nastavak se morate prijaviti svojim računom za %1."

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:71
msgctxt "@label:textbox bugzilla account email"
msgid "Email Address:"
msgstr "Adresa e-pošte:"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:77
msgctxt "@label:textbox bugzilla account password"
msgid "Password:"
msgstr "Lozinka:"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:84
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Save login information using the KDE Wallet system"
msgstr "Spremi podatke za prijavu u KDE-ov novčanik"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:91
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"<note>You need a user account on the <link url='%1'>KDE bug tracking system</"
"link> in order to file a bug report, because we may need to contact you "
"later\n"
"to request further information. If you do not have one, you can freely <link "
"url='%2'>create one here</link>. Please do not use disposable email "
"addresses.</note>"
msgstr "<note>Za prijavu greške potreban vam je korisnički račun u <link url='%1'>KDE-ovu sustavu za praćenje grešaka</link> jer ćemo vas možda morati naknadno kontaktirati\ni zatražiti dodatne informacije. Ako nemate račun, možete ga besplatno <link url='%2'>izraditi ovdje</link>. Nemojte koristiti privremene adrese e-pošte.</note>"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:105
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Login"
msgstr "Prijavi se"

#: qml/LoginPage.qml:106
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Use this button to login to the KDE bug tracking system using the provided "
"email address and password."
msgstr "Ovim se gumbom prijavite u KDE-ov sustav za praćenje grešaka pomoću navedene adrese e-pošte i lozinke."

#: qml/Main.qml:27
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>You cannot report this error, because <application>%1</application> "
"does not provide a bug reporting address.</para>"
msgstr "<para>Ne možete prijaviti ovu pogrešku jer <application>%1</application> ne navodi adresu za prijavu grešaka.</para>"

#: qml/Main.qml:34
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>As the Crash Handler itself has failed, the\n"
"automatic reporting process is disabled to reduce the\n"
"risks of failing again.<nl /><nl />\n"
"Please, <link url='%1'>manually report</link> this error\n"
"to the KDE bug tracking system. Do not forget to include\n"
"the backtrace from the <interface>Developer Information</interface>\n"
"page.</para>"
msgstr "<para>Budući da je i sam Obrađivač rušenja zakazao,\nautomatsko slanje izvješća onemogućeno je kako bi se smanjio\nrizik od ponovnog neuspjeha.<nl /><nl />\nRučno <link url='%1'>prijavite</link> ovu pogrešku\nu KDE-ovu sustavu za praćenje grešaka. Ne zaboravite priložiti\ntrag poziva sa stranice <interface>Podaci za razvojne inženjere</interface>.</para>"

#: qml/Main.qml:46
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>The reporting assistant is disabled because the crash handler dialog "
"was started in safe mode.<nl />\n"
"You can manually report this bug to <link>%1</link> (including the backtrace "
"from the <interface>Developer Information</interface> page.)</para>"
msgstr "<para>Pomoćnik za prijavu onemogućen je jer je dijaloški okvir obrađivača rušenja pokrenut u sigurnom načinu rada.<nl />\nOvu grešku možete ručno prijaviti na <link>%1</link> (uz trag poziva sa stranice <interface>Podaci za razvojne inženjere</interface>).</para>"

#: qml/Main.qml:53
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>The reporting assistant is disabled because\n"
"the crashed application appears to have been updated or\n"
"uninstalled since it had been started. This prevents accurate\n"
"crash reporting and can also be the cause of this crash.</para>\n"
"<para>After updating it is always a good idea to log out and back\n"
"in to make sure the update is fully applied and will not cause\n"
"any side effects.</para>"
msgstr "<para>Pomoćnik za prijavu onemogućen je jer se čini da je srušena aplikacija ažurirana ili\ndeinstalirana nakon pokretanja. Zbog toga prijava rušenja ne bi bila točna, a to je možda\ni uzrok rušenja.</para>\n<para>Nakon ažuriranja preporučuje se odjaviti se i ponovno prijaviti\nkako bi se ažuriranje u potpunosti primijenilo i ne bi uzrokovalo\nnuspojave.</para>"

#: qml/Main.qml:65
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>You can help us improve KDE Software by reporting this error.<nl /"
"><link url='%1'>Learn more about bug reporting.</link></para>"
msgstr "<para>Prijavom ove pogreške možete pomoći u poboljšanju KDE-ova softvera.<nl /><link url='%1'>Saznajte više o prijavi grešaka.</link></para>"

#: qml/Main.qml:95
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"There was not enough memory to gather crash information. You can close some "
"applications to free up memory and try again."
msgstr "Nije bilo dovoljno memorije za prikupljanje podataka o rušenju. Zatvorite neke aplikacije kako biste oslobodili memoriju pa pokušajte ponovno."

#: qml/Main.qml:101
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Gathering crash information failed. You can close the window, or <link "
"url='%1'>view detailed output</link>."
msgstr "Prikupljanje podataka o rušenju nije uspjelo. Možete zatvoriti prozor ili <link url='%1'>pregledati detaljan izlaz</link>."

#: qml/Main.qml:106
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Gathering crash information failed for unknown reasons. You can retry, close "
"the window, or <link url='%1'>view detailed output</link>."
msgstr "Prikupljanje podataka o rušenju nije uspjelo iz nepoznatih razloga. Možete pokušati ponovno, zatvoriti prozor ili <link url='%1'>pregledati detaljan izlaz</link>."

#: qml/Main.qml:109
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Gathering crash information failed for unknown reasons. You can retry, or "
"close the window."
msgstr "Prikupljanje podataka o rušenju nije uspjelo iz nepoznatih razloga. Možete pokušati ponovno ili zatvoriti prozor."

